00:22:48,741 --> 00:22:50,000
cast iron architecture.

293
00:22:50,001 --> 00:22:56,160
The all steel bridge's ornamental detailing has long been of special interest to many.

294
00:22:56,960 --> 00:23:03,620
When building the Manhattan Bridge, once they'd completed stringing the cables, workers hung the suspender ropes.

