00:23:04,860 --> 00:23:11,720
These are what comes down and holds the girders, the stringers in place, so that you can actually start putting down the deck.

296
00:23:11,721 --> 00:23:14,820
And they would usually start around the towers.

297
00:23:14,821 --> 00:23:20,140
Once they had the cables in place, they had their platforms in place, they would start

