417
00:32:48,041 --> 00:32:53,140
General Washington's fortifications occupied the GWB's anchorage sites when he led the

418
00:32:53,141 --> 00:32:56,900
American troops against the British in the battle for New York in the

419
00:32:56,901 --> 00:32:59,900
Revolutionary War.

420
00:32:59,901 --> 00:33:06,680
Next, the bridge that unified the boroughs of New York City.

421
00:33:06,681 --> 00:33:12,960
In 1885 Robert E. Audlin was the first to jump from the Brooklyn Bridge.

