00:33:39,821 --> 00:33:51,620
In a sweltering heat wave, 200,000 citizens turned out to be the first to cross the Triborough Bridge on opening day.

427
00:33:52,480 --> 00:33:58,440
That it was ever completed was due in large part to the complicated and powerful Robert Moses,

428
00:33:58,980 --> 00:34:03,620
who in turn brought in the designer of the George Washington Bridge, Othmar Amon.

429
00:34:03,960 --> 00:34:08,860
Robert Moses was the golden boy of New York of the 1920s and 30s.

430
00:34:08,861 --> 00:34:09,561
even 40s.

