437
00:34:41,700 --> 00:34:44,180
the chairman of the new Triborough Bridge Authority.

438
00:34:44,800 --> 00:34:47,360
Through President Franklin Roosevelt's New Deal,

439
00:34:47,880 --> 00:34:53,100
